# SAP Product Base Portfolio Report (QBR) Engine

An enterprise-grade portfolio governance framework connecting SAP S/4HANA logistics data (`MARA`/`MVKE`) and SAP Enterprise Portfolio and Project Management (`PPM`) bucket hierarchies with executive decision dashboards in Google Sheets.

The system executes automated fallback detection, Arthur D. Little (ADL) 4x4 strategic matrix positioning, OEM Long-Term Agreement (LTA) price-down calculations, and AI-augmented End-of-Life (EOL) Last-Time-Buy (LTB) forecasting.

